 /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://www.linkedin.com/in/vinicius-gross-castro&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Vinicius Castro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/CVE-Hunters/cve-hunters&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
