item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-10070-broken-access-control-in-enturmacao-em-loteid-endpoint&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-10070: Broken Access Control in &lt;code&gt;/enturmacao-em-lote/[ID]&lt;/code&gt; Endpoint
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CVE Publication: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-10070&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
