item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-9532-sql-injection-boolean-based-vulnerability-in-id-parameter-on-regraavaliacaoviewidid-endpoint&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-9532: SQL Injection (Boolean-Based) Vulnerability in &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; Parameter on &lt;code&gt;RegraAvaliacao/view?id=[id]&lt;/code&gt; Endpoint
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CVE Publication: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9532&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9532&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;summary&#34;&gt;Summary
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;A SQL Injection vulnerability was discovered in the &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; parameter of the &lt;code&gt;RegraAvaliacao/view?id=[id]&lt;/code&gt; endpoint. This issue allows any unauthenticated attacker to inject arbitrary SQL queries, potentially leading to unauthorized data access or further exploitation depending on database configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;The application fails to properly sanitize user-supplied input in the &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; parameter. As a result, specially crafted SQL payloads are interpreted directly by the backend database.&lt;/p&gt;

item.content:encoded:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-9532-sql-injection-boolean-based-vulnerability-in-id-parameter-on-regraavaliacaoviewidid-endpoint&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-9532: SQL Injection (Boolean-Based) Vulnerability in &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; Parameter on &lt;code&gt;RegraAvaliacao/view?id=[id]&lt;/code&gt; Endpoint
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CVE Publication: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9532&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9532&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;summary&#34;&gt;Summary
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;A SQL Injection vulnerability was discovered in the &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; parameter of the &lt;code&gt;RegraAvaliacao/view?id=[id]&lt;/code&gt; endpoint. This issue allows any unauthenticated attacker to inject arbitrary SQL queries, potentially leading to unauthorized data access or further exploitation depending on database configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;The application fails to properly sanitize user-supplied input in the &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; parameter. As a result, specially crafted SQL payloads are interpreted directly by the backend database.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;poc&#34;&gt;PoC
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vulnerable Endpoint: &lt;code&gt;RegraAvaliacao/view?id=[id]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parameter: &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;payload&#34;&gt;Payload:
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sqlmap -u &amp;#34;http://localhost:8086/module/RegraAvaliacao/view?id=1&amp;#34; -p id --cookie=&amp;#34;i_educar_session=qEk2wbjxS5IbECJGqnIa0dbmIyI3XIsXqm3WSh6K&amp;#34; \ --dbms=PostgreSQL --technique=B --dbs --batch
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
