item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-53824-cross-site-scripting-xss-reflected-endpoint-cadastro_petphp-parameter-msg&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-53824: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Reflected endpoint &lt;code&gt;cadastro_pet.php&lt;/code&gt; parameter &lt;code&gt;msg&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CVE Publication: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-53824&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
