 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;After that, we can use &lt;b&gt;&lt;code&gt;Nuclei&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/b&gt; to test for this vulnerability and automate the test:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
