item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-52474-sql-injection-vulnerability-in-id-parameter-on-controlphp-endpoint&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-52474: SQL Injection Vulnerability in &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; Parameter on &lt;code&gt;control.php&lt;/code&gt; Endpoint
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CVE Publication: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-52474&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-52474&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;summary&#34;&gt;Summary
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;A SQL Injection vulnerability was identified in the &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; parameter of the &lt;code&gt;/WeGIA/controle/control.php&lt;/code&gt; endpoint. This vulnerability allows attacker to manipulate SQL queries and access sensitive database information, such as table names and sensitive data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vulnerable Endpoint: &lt;code&gt;GET /controle/control.php?nomeClasse=MedicamentoControle&amp;amp;metodo=adicionarMedicamento&amp;amp;modulo=pet&amp;amp;nomeMedicamento=DApvMr&amp;amp;id=&amp;lt;PAYLOAD&amp;gt;&amp;amp;aplicacaoMedicamento=YqchRf&amp;amp;descricaoMedicamento=Mrnfdh HTTP/1.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parameter: &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
