 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Once uploaded, run the shell on the file path in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/WeGIA/html/socio/sistema/tabelas/shell.phar&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2025-22133/400774094-bc1f11c8-688d-422a-87c9-a1a8c746dcdb.png&#34;
