&lt;h2 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vulnerable Endpoint: &lt;code&gt;GET /html/geral/editar_permissoes.php&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parameter: &lt;code&gt;msg_c&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;The application fails to validate and sanitize user inputs in the &lt;code&gt;msg_c&lt;/code&gt; parameter. This lack of validation permits the injection of malicious payloads, which are reflected back to the user&#39;s browser in the server&#39;s response and executed within the context of the victim&#39;s browser.&lt;/p&gt;
