item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-22141-sql-injection-blind-time-based-endpoint-verificar_recursos_cargophp-parameter-cargo&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-22141: SQL Injection (Blind Time-Based) endpoint &lt;code&gt;verificar_recursos_cargo.php&lt;/code&gt; parameter &lt;code&gt;cargo&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CVE Publication: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-22141&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-22141&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;summary&#34;&gt;Summary
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;A SQL Injection vulnerability was identified in the &lt;code&gt;/dao/verificar_recursos_cargo.php&lt;/code&gt; endpoint, specifically in the &lt;code&gt;cargo&lt;/code&gt;  parameter. This vulnerability allows attackers to execute arbitrary SQL commands, compromising the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of the database.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vulnerable Endpoint: &lt;code&gt;/dao/verificar_recursos_cargo.php&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parameter: &lt;code&gt;cargo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;The application fails to properly validate and sanitize user inputs in the &lt;code&gt;cargo&lt;/code&gt; parameter. This allows attackers to inject malicious SQL payloads that are executed directly by the database. This could result in unauthorized access to sensitive information, data manipulation, and operational disruptions.&lt;/p&gt;

